\f1\b \cf0 Core principle\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 ONE CODEBASE. ONE GAME STACK. TWO MOBILE PLATFORMS. VARIABLE CONTENT.\
More specifically:\
CODE IS SHARED. CONTENT IS VARIABLE. THEME IS VARIABLE. GAME RULES ARE CONFIGURABLE. PLATFORM CODE IS MINIMAL.\
A new game should require minimal engineering work.\
Target:\
Game #1 \uc0\u8594  significant development\
Game #2 \uc0\u8594  mostly configuration + content + art\
Game #3 \uc0\u8594  increasingly automated\
Game #12 \uc0\u8594  ideally a large percentage of the production process is automated.\
The ultimate factory should let a small team go from:\

\f1\b game idea \uc0\u8594  generated game definition \u8594  generated content/assets \u8594  validation \u8594  iOS + Android build \u8594  store submission
\f0\b0 \
with minimal manual engineering for each new title.\
